# Line endings are the repo's decision, not the machine's: every text file is LF,
# on every platform, regardless of core.autocrlf. This kills the "LF will be replaced
# by CRLF" warning noise on Windows and keeps blob hashes byte-identical everywhere —
# which matters more than usual here, since scope items and the embedding cache key on
# blob SHAs (a CRLF-flipped file would re-embed as new content).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never text-converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.wasm binary
*.onnx binary
*.db binary
